OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits coaching children while
OL,4,Aon barred list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has admitted coaching a youth
OL,7,Ffootball club despite being banned from
OL,8,Fworking with children will be sentenced
OL,9,Fin January.
OL,11,FCourtney Branagan, 37, from Hull, was
OL,12,Ffound not guilty of sexual activity
OL,13,Fwith young girls in 2017 but was put on
OL,14,Fthe Disclosure and Barring Service
OL,15,F(DBS) Children's Barred List in 2019,
OL,16,FHull Magistrates' Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
