OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits coaching children while
OL,4,Aon barred list
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared at court earlier where he
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to engaging in regulated
OL,8,Factivity with children while being on
OL,9,Fthe Children's Barred List after
OL,10,Fcoaching East Riding Rangers FC's Under
OL,11,F10s team from 2024 until 2026.
OL,13,FBranagan, who is due to be sentenced on
OL,14,F19 January, was bailed on condition he
OL,15,Fdoes not contact any children in a
OL,16,Fcoaching capacity.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
